-- N3 grammar.
--
-- Same rules as 009 and 015: the point LIST is a fact about the exam, every
-- word of the prose is written for this app, nothing is imported, and each
-- point ships `published` at status 'in-review' until a human signs it off.
--
-- sort_index continues at 200. Points already taught at N5 or N4 are not
-- restated: (language_id, slug) is unique, so a duplicate row would silently
-- never insert.

ON CONFLICT (language_id, slug) DO NOTHING;
